\
- web (gpt-5.5): **[Tasteful Design](https://github.com/spsk-dev/tasteful-design)** (7 specialist agents, SHIP/CONDITIONAL/BLOCK verdicts) and **[10x](https://github.com/fariraimasocha/10x)** (focused polish skills + `/polish` orchestrator)\
- scan (gemini-3.5-flash): **StyleSeed (bitjaru/styleseed)** with 74 visual rules + 15 executable skills, and **Claude Design Mode (OkminLee/claude-design-mode)** which has a dedicated AI-Slop Verifier subagent with a 7-point checklist\
- social (grok-4.3): **taste-skill (Leonxlnx)** with hierarchy/spacing/whitespace/density/motion gates\
