\
- web (gpt-5.5): **[Storybook MCP](https://storybook.js.org/docs/ai/mcp/overview.md)** for documented component reuse, **[shadcn Skills + MCP](https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/skills)** if you're on shadcn/Tailwind\
