- **"405 inspiration pages" for design-builder, "281 apps" for anti-slop-design** \'97 specific numbers from a single specialist (analysis).\
- **"5/5 on aiskill.market leaderboard"** for Impeccable \'97 analysis (deepseek-v4-pro) only; specific source not linked.\
- **Hue (by @dominikmartn)** \'97 surfaced only by social (grok-4.3) at hueapp.io. The same author appears in scan (gemini-3.5-flash) as the creator of "Nothing Design Skill" \'97 these are presumably different skills by the same person, but no specialist verified this.\
- **Social's "Designer Skills collection"** with `/design-flow`, `/design-brief`, etc. \'97 described without a specific repo link; cannot spot-check.\
- **Specific aesthetic claims** like "the most refined black isn't #000, it's #2A2A2A" (StyleSeed, per scan) \'97 these are taste assertions, not measured findings.\
