\
## Practical Setup (web specialist's commands, verified format)\
\
```bash\
# Anthropic's official frontend design plugin (consensus pick)\
/plugin install frontend-design@claude-plugins-official\
\
# Figma official plugin\
claude plugin install figma@claude-plugins-official\
\
# Playwright MCP for visual verification\
claude mcp add playwright npx @playwright/mcp@latest\
\
# Context7 for fresh library docs (web specialist's recommendation)\
/plugin marketplace add upstash/context7\
/plugin install context7@context7-marketplace\
```\
\
For Impeccable, install per its [GitHub README](https://github.com/pbakaus/impeccable). For Storybook MCP: `npx storybook add @storybook/addon-mcp`. For shadcn: `npx shadcn@latest mcp init --client claude`.\
\
---\
\
## My Decisive Recommendation by Use Case\
\
**Greenfield, ship today:** Anthropic Frontend Design + Impeccable. *(All four specialists converge on this \'97 strongest signal in the report.)*\
\
**Existing Figma design system, need code fidelity:** Anthropic Frontend Design + Figma plugin/MCP + Throughline. *(web (gpt-5.5) + scan (gemini-3.5-flash) agree on Figma; analysis (deepseek-v4-pro) endorses Throughline as the right architecture.)*\
\
**Real production app with 40+ screens:** Don't rely on plugins alone. Build machine-readable tokens (consider **nib** per analysis), enforce them with CI lint rules, then add Impeccable for polish and design-loop or Playwright MCP for visual verification. *(This is a single-specialist recommendation from analysis (deepseek-v4-pro), but the reasoning is structurally sound and the other specialists implicitly support the components \'97 they just don't connect them into a workflow.)*\
\
**Want truly fresh, exploratory design (not just clean execution):** anti-slop-design (mbeato) is the only corpus-grounded *generative* alternative tool surfaced. *(Single source: analysis specialist. The setup is reportedly brutal \'97 Bun + Ollama + ~8 GB + GPU \'97 so weigh the cost.)*\
\
---\
\
**Caveat on the whole report:** This ecosystem moves fast. The strongest claims here (Anthropic Frontend Design, Impeccable, Figma MCP) are corroborated across multiple specialists and link to authoritative docs. The community-skill recommendations (StyleSeed, Tasteful Design, 10x, Hue, taste-skill, design-loop, anti-slop-design) are each sourced from a single specialist's research and you should spot-check the linked repos before adopting.\
